@startuml Idea_and_Comment_Moderation_States
' Edison UPM - Idea and comment moderation statuses (Sprint 3, task 3.3.7, US 3.3 Admin idea and comment management)
' Design proposal. Starts from the statuses implemented in Sprint 1:
'  - IdeaStatus DRAFT, PUBLISHED, ARCHIVED (model/IdeaStatus.java, IdeaService.publish/archive)
'  - CommentStatus VISIBLE, DELETED (model/CommentStatus.java, soft delete in CommentService)
' and adds HIDDEN_BY_ADMIN to both. Only an ADMINISTRATOR can enter or leave it.

title Edison UPM - Idea and Comment Moderation Statuses (Sprint 3)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam dpi 130
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F1F1F1
  BorderColor #555555
}
skinparam state<<new>> {
  BackgroundColor #FFF4D6
  BorderColor #B8860B
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
}

state "Idea" as IDEA {
  state "DRAFT" as I_DRAFT : Only the founder sees it
  state "PUBLISHED" as I_PUB : Visible by its visibility\n(PUBLIC / UPM_COMMUNITY)
  state "ARCHIVED" as I_ARCH : Only the founder sees it
  state "HIDDEN_BY_ADMIN" as I_HIDDEN <<new>> : Only the founder and\nadministrators see it

  [*] --> I_DRAFT : founder creates draft
  I_DRAFT --> I_DRAFT : founder edits steps
  I_DRAFT --> I_PUB : founder publishes\n[all steps valid]
  I_PUB --> I_ARCH : founder archives
  I_PUB --> I_HIDDEN : <b>admin hides</b>\n[reason given]
  I_HIDDEN --> I_PUB : <b>admin restores</b>\n[reason given]
  I_ARCH --> [*]
}

state "Comment" as COMMENT {
  state "VISIBLE" as C_VIS : Listed on the idea
  state "DELETED" as C_DEL : Soft delete: kept in DB,\nnot listed
  state "HIDDEN_BY_ADMIN" as C_HIDDEN <<new>> : Not listed; the author sees\n"Hidden by moderation"

  [*] --> C_VIS : user posts comment
  C_VIS --> C_VIS : author edits
  C_VIS --> C_DEL : author deletes
  C_VIS --> C_HIDDEN : <b>admin hides</b>\n[reason given]
  C_HIDDEN --> C_VIS : <b>admin restores</b>\n[reason given]
  C_DEL --> [*]
}

note bottom of IDEA
  <b>While an idea is HIDDEN_BY_ADMIN</b>
  Left out of browse and search; others get 404.
  The founder sees it with a banner and the reason,
  but cannot edit or archive it until it is restored.
  Its comments are kept; no new comments or metrics.
  DRAFT and ARCHIVED ideas are not public,
  so they are not moderated.
end note

note bottom of COMMENT
  <b>Rules</b>
  The author cannot edit or delete a hidden comment.
  A DELETED comment cannot be hidden or restored.
  Hiding an idea does not change its comments' statuses.
end note

legend right
  |= Colour |= Meaning |
  |<#F1F1F1> | Implemented (Sprint 1) |
  |<#FFF4D6> | New in Sprint 3 (US 3.3) |
  | <b>bold</b> | Only an ADMINISTRATOR |
  Every admin action needs a reason (10..500 characters),
  shown to the founder or author.
  Database: CHECK on ideas.status and comments.status
  must add 'HIDDEN_BY_ADMIN'.
endlegend
@enduml
